+Added reserved code/status mappings for:
+- Annuity
+- Collections (Dunning / Bad Debt)
+- Commission
+- Consulting / Search
+
+Added representative mappings including:
+- `ANNUITY_TASK_NOT_FOUND` (404)
+- `ANNUITY_DRAFT_ALREADY_GENERATED` (409)
+- `DUNNING_BATCH_NOT_FOUND` (404)
+- `BAD_DEBT_ALREADY_MARKED` (409)
+- `COMMISSION_RULE_NOT_FOUND` (404)
+- `COMMISSION_RULE_CONFLICT` (409)
+- `CONSULTING_EXPENSE_NOT_FOUND` (404)
+- `CONSULTING_CONFLICT` (409)
