+## Error Response Contract
+Documented current dual-envelope behavior:
+- Preferred `{"error":{...}}` for BusinessError and validation.
+- Legacy `{"detail":"..."}` for some existing endpoints.
+
+Added post-enhancement rule that new domains MUST use BusinessError envelope and status semantics `400/401/403/404/409/422`.
+
+## Post-enhancement Domain Status Semantics
+Added explicit semantics for annuity/collections/commission/consulting domains and noted they are not yet routed as of 2026-02-28.
+Documented temporary route-level 404 behavior (`{"detail":"Not Found"}`) until routers are implemented.
@@
